{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S11（22秒）和S12（25秒）的感受提示偏密，实际扫读可能来不及；S07也删掉了Y中“早知道这样还会走吗”这一句，削弱了人物的自我追问。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X把叙事和感受按时间顺序交替呈现，重点词加亮后容易抓住每段核心，感受随音乐出现也减少了一次性面对大量短词的负担。它更清楚地呈现了人物从不甘、怀念、孤独到重新安顿自己的心理因果，而且对声音、身体反应和情绪转折的描写更具体细腻。Y虽然叙事句自然，但右侧感受词容易形成并列堆积，观众能感受到情绪，却不一定能分辨情绪如何一步步变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e5523fe7-0e99-493d-8f3e-b4bdf6be06ee", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T005504039438Z", "elapsed_seconds": 58.093, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:56:02.131276+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9f23e211d98d39b06d43ca9bd155074bcc5452ef4d47224dee56f851b4000240", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we